OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty unit auctions planned to
OL,4,Ahelp town's revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FJan O'Hara, the council's executive
OL,7,Fmember for planning and economic
OL,8,Fgrowth, said it would "give us an
OL,9,Fadditional tool to tackle long-term
OL,10,Fvacancy and help bring empty premises
OL,11,Fback into productive use".
